        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Luring Laugh"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(enchantment, incapacitation, mental, primal)\n\nRequirements: The ghul is in its hyena shape\n\nThe ghul lets out an alluring chitter. Each creature in a 60-foot emanation must succeed at a 19 Will save or become fascinated, flat-footed, and compelled to move toward the ghul on the creature's turn. The effect lasts until the end of the ghul's next turn, but the ghul can Sustain a Spell on Luring Laugh. If the ghul attacks, the fascinated condition ends for only the creature that's attacked. On a successful save, a creature is temporarily immune to Luring Laugh for 24 hours."
            },
